6a93c3-6aab-464e-a899-3515fb1ef8f2"}], "graph_id": "6215ee02-990d-11ea-9766-0242ac130005", "map_popup": [{"language": "en", "value": "<p>A stone inscription at&nbsp;\u015a\u0101kyamuni Buddha Shrine,&nbsp;Balambu,&nbsp;Chandragiri, Kathmandu&nbsp;re the installation of the statue (NS 1077)</p>\n"}], "permissions": {"users_with_no_access": [], "users_without_delete_perm": [], "users_without_edit_perm": [], "users_without_read_perm": []}, "points": [{"nodegroup_id": "e871483e-c2b1-11ea-a1e8-0242ac120007", "point": {"lat": 27.69082672841668, "lon": 85.24518455018284}, "provisional": false}], "provisional_resource": "false", "resourceinstanceid": "47870160-0fcf-4ae6-b0ad-b532c4b80ba7", "root_ontology_class": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E34_Inscription"}}, {"_id": "222a5a4a-e1ef-4af0-afc9-bae7bd03d3ce", "_ignored": ["tiles.data.2ab25f4a-9323-11e9-8381-0242ac120006.en.value.keyword", "tiles.data.26ac8fa4-af81-11e9-a3d8-0242ac120005.en.value.keyword", "tiles.data.66fd9c70-ce1b-11e9-b993-0242ac140002.en.value.keyword", "tiles.data.d9f64830-9fc2-11e9-a638-0242ac140004.en.value.keyword", "tiles.data.d9f64efc-9fc2-11e9-a638-0242ac140004.en.value.keyword"], "_index": "danam_resources", "_score": 0.0, "_source": {"displaydescription": "<p>The Buddha statue enshrined in this small shrine is one of the biggest statues in Balambu. The shrine is located west of the street leading to the southern gateway to the city. The statue (which faces) east is constructed out of a single stone.</p>\n\n<p>The Buddha exhibiting the&nbsp;<em>bh\u016bmispar\u015bamudr\u0101</em>&nbsp;is seated on a double-decked lotus throne placed on a stone plinth. Generally, Buddha statues are not adorned except for his classical features such as elongated ears, curly hairs, and half-closed eyelids. This motif is followed here too.</p>\n\n<p>An inscription below the statue states it was established by \u015aakhal\u0101la, his wife \u0100s\u0101m\u0101y\u0101 and their two daughters in NS 1077 (1957 CE). Around a decade ago, iron railings were welded around the statue for its safekeeping. Around the same time, a roof was constructed above the statue and was capped by a metal&nbsp;<em>caitya&nbsp;</em>(local knowledge, Maharjana, male, 63 years).&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/2247442/nhdp-bibliography/search/Pruscha/titleCreatorYear/items/Q528C497/item-list\">Pruscha</a></strong>&nbsp;(1975, 155) has published a photo of this statue before the railing was installed. &nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>\u015aakhal\u0101la&rsquo;s family members take care of the statue. However, they do not perform any anniversary rituals.</p>\n\n<p>The members of the local communities worship the statue here on auspicious occasions, such as procession, festivals and so forth.</p>\n", "displayname": "\u015a\u0101kyamuni Buddha Shrine (consecrated in 1957 CE) || \u0936\u093e\u0915\u094d\u092f\u092e\u0941\u0928\u093f \u092c\u0941\u0926\u094d\u0927 ll BAL0008 ll ", "displayname_language": "en", "geometries": [{"geom": {"features": [{"geometry": {"coordinates": [85.24518455018284, 27.69082672841668], "type": "Point"}, "id": "25a8c42639f1bb6c627fec819cedefaa", "properties": {"nodeId": "d61d682c-b0fe-11e9-8b01-0242ac120006"}, "type": "Feature"}], "type": "FeatureCollection"}, "nodegroup_id": "d61d682c-b0fe-11e9-8b01-0242ac120006", "provisional": false, "tileid": "5aa050fc-21d8-4f74-ac96-35bbbd6369e1"}], "graph_id": "f35cc1ca-9322-11e9-a5cc-0242ac120006", "map_popup": [{"language": "en", "value": "<p>The Buddha statue enshrined in this small shrine is one of the biggest statues in Balambu. The shrine is located west of the street leading to the southern gateway to the city. The statue (which faces) east is constructed out of a single stone.</p>\n\n<p>The Buddha exhibiting the&nbsp;<em>bh\u016bmispar\u015bamudr\u0101</em>&nbsp;is seated on a double-decked lotus throne placed on a stone plinth. Generally, Buddha statues are not adorned except for his classical features such as elongated ears, curly hairs, and half-closed eyelids. This motif is followed here too.</p>\n\n<p>An inscription below the statue states it was established by \u015aakhal\u0101la, his wife \u0100s\u0101m\u0101y\u0101 and their two daughters in NS 1077 (1957 CE). Around a decade ago, iron railings were welded around the statue for its safekeeping. Around the same time, a roof was constructed above the statue and was capped by a metal&nbsp;<em>caitya&nbsp;</em>(local knowledge, Maharjana, male, 63 years).&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/2247442/nhdp-bibliography/search/Pruscha/titleCreatorYear/items/Q528C497/item-list\">Pruscha</a></strong>&nbsp;(1975, 155) has published a photo of this statue before the railing was installed. &nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>\u015aakhal\u0101la&rsquo;s family members take care of the statue. However, they do not perform any anniversary rituals.</p>\n\n<p>The members of the local communities worship the statue here on auspicious occasions, such as procession, festivals and so forth.</p>\n"}], "permissions": {"users_with_no_access": [], "users_without_delete_perm": [], "users_without_edit_perm": [], "users_without_read_perm": []}, "points": [{"nodegroup_id": "d61d682c-b0fe-11e9-8b01-0242ac120006", "point": {"lat": 27.69082672841668, "lon": 85.24518455018284}, "provisional": false}], "provisional_resource": "false", "resourceinstanceid": "222a5a4a-e1ef-4af0-afc9-bae7bd03d3ce", "root_ontology_class": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E71_Man-Made_Thing"}}, {"_id": "53347b36-9092-4f37-8af1-43bdbc6b18d1", "_ignored": ["tiles.data.c0dc905a-9910-11ea-9766-0242ac130005.en.value.keyword", "tiles.data.2591e954-9a98-11ea-82af-0242ac130005.en.value.keyword", "tiles.data.d91cb788-990d-11ea-9766-0242ac130005.en.value.keyword"], "_index": "danam_resources", "_score": 0.0, "_source": {"displaydescription": "KAT1220_I_008", "displayname": "KAT1220_I_008 A stone\u00a0inscription at\u00a0Itum\u0323 Ba\u0304ha\u0304h\u0323,\u00a0Itum\u0323 Ba\u0304ha\u0304h\u03